  "2026-10-23T07:47:51.015Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral guard revert proof: changed only resolveFragment uniqueness handling so duplicate exact quotes were accepted. The targeted real-tracker regression failed 1 test. Restored source byte-for-byte. Independently changed only checkCitation freshness to use whole-source revision equality; the outside-edit regression failed 1 test. Restored source byte-for-byte. Tests import TypeScript directly, so no stale build could mask either negative control."
  "2026-10-23T08:30:00.580Z",codex-agent,"PR 1 blocking review: prevent a surviving quote in an unrelated passage from replacing changed cited evidence; require saved surrounding context and Markdown section ancestry. Also preserve exact JSON value bytes so distinct large integer lexemes cannot hash as the same value. Add real-tracker check and affected regressions, function-only revert proofs, and complete release gates."
  "2026-10-23T08:51:08.552Z",codex-agent,"PR 1 passage-identity revert proof: restored only resolveFragment from reviewed head b6ef9b5. The real-tracker surviving-quote regression failed 1 test: changed policy evidence was incorrectly current. Restored the fixed function byte-for-byte. The positive suite also verifies unchanged immediate context cannot hide a changed Markdown ancestor, and affected includes both review targets. New heading records store section ancestry; legacy records fail closed after source changes."
  "2026-10-23T08:51:09.167Z",codex-agent,"PR 1 lossless JSON revert proof: restored only pointer from reviewed head b6ef9b5, retaining all new tests and other fixed functions. The real-tracker 9007199254740992 to 9007199254740993 regression failed 1 test because the old floating-point parse reported current. Restored source byte-for-byte. The new parser hashes exact value spans, preserves number/string lexemes and internal whitespace, rejects duplicate decoded keys, and fences legacy lossy descriptors after source changes."
  "2026-10-23T15:21:28.997Z",codex-agent,"DELIVERED: merged PR #1 (210cc3a319d3f61b4bad69fecbcb741dac61aa7b) is an ancestor of audited main 1bb9e2bfebdde13041e75f5fa9889a97ed577052. Inspected on main: test/evidence.test.ts, test/review-regressions.test.ts. Independent resolution/freshness, source/fragment digests, outside edits and movement, retained replay, bounded inert differences, omission receipts and persisted observations are present; changed passage/JSON identity fails closed. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
